{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1021570-hurt-locker-violence-groups-sheets","id":1021570,"title":"[Hurt Locker] Violence Groups Sheets","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-24T08:00:15-08:00","id":1021570,"title":"[Hurt Locker] Violence Groups Sheets","content":"So <b>Hurt Locker</b> book introduce new organisations templates that let you create gangs, hate groups. cults or corrupt forces ( and in reality, any mostly human faction ) called Violence Groups. Cool would be to have editable group sheet for it. So maybe if we agree on prototype, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> would made one in free time? Here are my propositions on those.<br /> <br /> First one is <b>Violence Groups Sheet</b> ( can be just renamed 'Faction Sheet' in my POV ) prototype:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zmyWChv.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>Primary, Secondary and Tetriaity Pools would be selectable list, like various Factions options to be chosen on typical supernatural sheets.<br /> <br /> <b>Second one to be made is Individual Members Sheet</b> - as it use rules for making normal characters with full Attributes and Skills, I think just using <a href=\"https://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/NWOD/CofD_NPCSheet2-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">CoD NPC Sheet</a> as template. Only real change is that there should Aspirations section should be on first page, in each column, just after 'Name/Concept/Virtue &amp; Vice/ etc.' section.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts and comments are welcome. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-24-2016, 11:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-24T08:04:42-08:00","id":1021572,"title":"","content":"Seeing now this, I think that first 'Name:' line on Groups prototype should be 'Groups Name:' instead - for clarifications reasons. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T15:10:49-08:00","id":1022101,"title":"","content":"Sure, just let me know once you have it hashed out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> I'll add it to the list...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet 